          "workType": "test",
          "acceptanceAnchors": [],
          "testContract": {
            "question": "在本工作区的 AlembicPlugin 检出（main 分支）中，实现目标落地的 `docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 是否满足验收标准 1–5：文件存在且为普通文件、逐字节内容为两行共 44 字节、`docs/` 状态相对基线只多这一个未跟踪文件、HEAD 提交不变、HEAD 仍在 main？",
            "objectBoundary": "被测对象是本工作区 AlembicPlugin 检出中的 `docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 以及该检出的 git 状态（`docs/` 下的未跟踪条目、HEAD 与分支）；只观察、不修改。其他仓库、其他文件与验收标准 6–10 不在本测试范围内（由 Controller 核对）。",
            "steps": [
              {
                "stepId": "ts-1",
                "given": "本工作区的 AlembicPlugin 检出（main 分支）处于实现目标被接受后的状态，测试开始前未做任何改动；命令在 AlembicPlugin 仓库根目录运行。",
                "when": "运行 `test -f docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md && test ! -L docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md; echo $?`。",
                "then": "输出 `0`：该路径存在，是普通文件（不是符号链接，也不是目录）。",
                "requirementRef": {
                  "recordDigest": "sha256:62655c15cbad1a526ed6f3934899016716845387edac9ec9b59374b5510ee440",
                  "sectionAnchor": "acceptance-criteria",
                  "itemId": "ac-1"
                }
              },
              {
                "stepId": "ts-2",
                "given": "同 ts-1；命令在 AlembicPlugin 仓库根目录运行。",
                "when": "依次运行 `wc -c < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md`、`shasum -a 256 docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md` 与 `od -c docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md`。",
                "then": "`wc -c` 输出 44；SHA-256 为 `87366ae7e04fbf5445e9330cdbc5130e112d2529bad638494bda3f4ec00566fd`；`od -c` 逐字节显示 `# Wakeflow smoke round 6`、一个 `\\n`、`round six verified`、一个 `\\n`，末行偏移为 `0000054`（共 44 字节），没有 BOM、没有 `\\r`、没有第三行。",
                "requirementRef": {
                  "recordDigest": "sha256:62655c15cbad1a526ed6f3934899016716845387edac9ec9b59374b5510ee440",
                  "sectionAnchor": "acceptance-criteria",
                  "itemId": "ac-2"
                }
              },
              {
                "stepId": "ts-3",
                "given": "同 ts-1；基线为实现前的四行 `?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke.md`。",
                "when": "在 AlembicPlugin 仓库根目录运行 `git --no-optional-locks status --porcelain docs/`。",
                "then": "恰好五行且都是 `??` 状态：`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round3.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round4.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md`、`?? docs/wakeflow-smoke.md`；相对基线只多出 `?? docs/wakeflow-smoke-round6.md`，没有暂存或其他状态的条目。",
                "requirementRef": {
                  "recordDigest": "sha256:62655c15cbad1a526ed6f3934899016716845387edac9ec9b59374b5510ee440",
                  "sectionAnchor": "acceptance-criteria",
                  "itemId": "ac-3"
                }
              },
              {
                "stepId": "ts-4",
                "given": "同 ts-1；命令在 AlembicPlugin 仓库根目录运行。",
                "when": "运行 `git --no-optional-locks rev-parse HEAD`。",
                "then": "输出 `7b2c53aae21489d2daad651a0261d02c6d1bdd95`。",
                "requirementRef": {
                  "recordDigest": "sha256:62655c15cbad1a526ed6f3934899016716845387edac9ec9b59374b5510ee440",
                  "sectionAnchor": "acceptance-criteria",
                  "itemId": "ac-4"
                }
              },
              {
                "stepId": "ts-5",
                "given": "同 ts-1；命令在 AlembicPlugin 仓库根目录运行。",
                "when": "运行 `git --no-optional-locks symbolic-ref HEAD`。",
                "then": "输出 `refs/heads/main`。",
                "requirementRef": {
                  "recordDigest": "sha256:62655c15cbad1a526ed6f3934899016716845387edac9ec9b59374b5510ee440",
                  "sectionAnchor": "acceptance-criteria",
                  "itemId": "ac-5"
                }
              }
            ],
